  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BCW will work with communities in Kenya marginalised through poverty and climate change. The project aims to empower women, girls and youth to reach their full potential, through access to improved health, education and economic empowerment opportunities. The project will focus on Sexual Reproductive Health and Rights, Community Health, Maternal and Child health, Ending Female Genital Mutilation, Life Skills, Healthy Schools, Healthy Resilient Homesteads and Economic Empowerment.</narrative>
